@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

@prefix claim: <https://product-trustworthiness.local/claim#> .
claim: a owl:Ontology .
claim:Claim a owl:Class .
claim:ReleaseClaim a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf claim:Claim .
claim:SafetyCase a owl:Class .
claim:Evidence a owl:Class .
claim:context a owl:ObjectProperty .
claim:validWindow a owl:DatatypeProperty .
claim:claimStatement a owl:DatatypeProperty .
claim:claimStatus a owl:DatatypeProperty .
claim:evidenceStatus a owl:DatatypeProperty .
claim:containsClaim a owl:ObjectProperty .
claim:supportsClaim a owl:ObjectProperty .
claim:backedByEvidence a owl:ObjectProperty .
